  > 2 │ <div><li /></div>
      │      ^^^^^^
    3 │ <ul>{#if visible}<div><li>Indirect child</li></div>{/if}</ul>
    4 │ {#snippet item()}
  
  i List items need a list container to form a valid HTML list.
  
  i Make this element a direct child of <ul>, <ol>, or <menu>.
  
  i This rule belongs to the nursery group, which means it is not yet stable and may change in the future. Visit https://biomejs.dev/linter/#nursery for more information.
  

